#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:1
msgid "Jing'an"
msgstr "静安区"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:4
msgid "Enterprise AI, data services and digital commerce"
msgstr "企业级AI、数据服务与数字商业"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:6
msgid ""
"The 2026-2028 AI application demonstration plan focuses on industry "
"integration and talent. Its stated objectives must be distinguished from "
"implementing rules and currently accepting applications."
msgstr "2026至2028年人工智能创新应用示范区方案聚焦产业融合与人才。规划目标应与实施细则及正在受理的申报事项区分。"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Evidence S053 "
"<https://www.jingan.gov.cn/govxxgk/JA2/2026-03-27/1b9b0944-356c-4561-b157-502a9e1af84d.html>`_. "
"静安区发展和改革委员会、静安区科技和经济委员会关于印发《静安区打造人工智能创新应用示范区三年行动方案（2026—2028年）》的通知."
msgstr "`资料来源 S053 <https://www.jingan.gov.cn/govxxgk/JA2/2026-03-27/1b9b0944-356c-4561-b157-502a9e1af84d.html>`_. 静安区发展和改革委员会、静安区科技和经济委员会关于印发《静安区打造人工智能创新应用示范区三年行动方案（2026—2028年）》的通知."

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:10
msgid "Who receives the inquiry"
msgstr "联系哪个部门"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:13
msgid "Jing'an science and economy authority"
msgstr "静安区科技和经济委员会"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:15
msgid "`Official district website <https://www.jingan.gov.cn/>`_"
msgstr "`区政府官网 <https://www.jingan.gov.cn/>`_"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:17
msgid ""
"Use the official website to request the responsible team and current "
"application route. Email addresses are not reproduced in this publication."
msgstr "请通过官网咨询具体负责部门及最新申请方式。本图谱不公开电子邮箱地址。"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:19
msgid "Before applying"
msgstr "申请前需确认"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:22
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "以下步骤为本书整理的申请参考，实际办理流程以最新官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:24
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读有明确发布日期的通知，确认属地、申请主体、业务及费用发生期间等条件。"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:26
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "按清单准备材料，并按要求取得依托单位或区级部门推荐。"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:28
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止时间前通过官方平台提交，保存受理回执。"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:30
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "按通知要求完成评审、立项、报告、验收及资金拨付手续。"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:32
msgid ""
"Ask which current notice governs the project, whether registration and "
"actual operations must both be in the district, which expenditure period "
"is eligible, and whether previous municipal or district awards exclude a "
"claim. Obtain the answer before moving a company or incurring costs."
msgstr "申请前应确认适用的最新通知，企业注册地和实际经营地是否都须在本区，哪些期间的费用可以申报，以及已获市级或区级资助是否影响本次申请。企业迁址或发生支出前，应先取得明确答复。"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:34
msgid "Local organizations in this atlas"
msgstr "本区收录机构"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:37
msgid ""
":doc:`Shibei Hi-Tech Park / Shutong Valley & Daning Carriers "
"</entities/shibei-valley>` (市北高新园区／数通链谷与大宁科创载体 · Technology park · "
"Software AI, Industry) — Jing'an's 2026-2028 AI demonstration plan and "
"district carrier program anchor big-data, blockchain (Shutong Valley), "
"cloud computing and enterprise AI workspaces across Shibei Hi-Tech Park, "
"Daning and Suhewan. Confirm the specific carrier operator, "
"data-compliance services and tenancy terms. [Status: Published entity; "
"intake to confirm]"
msgstr ":doc:`市北高新园区／数通链谷与大宁科创载体 </entities/shibei-valley>` （科技园区 · AI软件、产业）： 静安2026至2028年AI示范区方案以市北高新、数通链谷、大宁和苏河湾等为核心，集聚大数据、区块链、云计算及企业级AI资源。申请前需明确具体运营主体、数据合规服务及入驻条款。【状态：机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认】"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:38
msgid ""
":doc:`Shanghai Theatre Academy </entities/university-theatre>` (上海戏剧学院 · "
"University) — Institutional entry in the June 2026 Ministry of Education "
"register. Suggested collaboration themes: Performance, virtual "
"production, creative media. These themes are editorial routing guidance, "
"not a verified offer of laboratory access or startup funding. [Status: "
"Published entity; intake to confirm]"
msgstr ":doc:`上海戏剧学院 </entities/university-theatre>` （高校）： 该校列入教育部2026年6月公布的高校名录。可关注的合作方向包括：表演、虚拟制作、创意媒体。这些方向仅供寻找合作方时参考，不代表已确认可使用相关实验室或获得创业资助。【状态：机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认】"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:39
msgid ""
":doc:`Shanghai University </entities/university-shu>` (上海大学 · University) "
"— Institutional entry in the June 2026 Ministry of Education register. "
"Suggested collaboration themes: Manufacturing, robotics, materials, "
"digital media. These themes are editorial routing guidance, not a "
"verified offer of laboratory access or startup funding. [Status: "
"Published entity; intake to confirm]"
msgstr ":doc:`上海大学 </entities/university-shu>` （高校）： 该校列入教育部2026年6月公布的高校名录。可关注的合作方向包括：制造、机器人、材料、数字媒体。这些方向仅供寻找合作方时参考，不代表已确认可使用相关实验室或获得创业资助。【状态：机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认】"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:41
msgid "Funding routes"
msgstr "融资与扶持渠道"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:44
msgid ""
":doc:`Jing'an Service Industry Guidance Fund and AI Demonstration "
"Support, 2026 </funding/jingan-service-2026>` (2026静安服务业发展引导资金与人工智能示范支持 · "
"Grant · No equity) — Project-specific support under the district "
"service-industry guidance fund rules, matched to qualifying project "
"investment. Status: 2026 call published; deadline check required. Timing: "
"Second 2026 batch published May 2026; confirm current sub-district "
"recommending window."
msgstr ":doc:`2026静安服务业发展引导资金与人工智能示范支持 </funding/jingan-service-2026>` （补助 · 不占股）： 依区服务业发展引导资金办法给予支持，按符合条件的项目总投资及类别核定。状态：2026年通知已公布，需确认截止时间。时间：2026年第二批通知于5月发布，须向所属街镇或功能区确认当前推荐受理时间。"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:46
msgid ":doc:`Also compare citywide funding </funding>`"
msgstr ":doc:`同时比较全市融资与扶持渠道 </funding>`"

